{"benchmark_id": "bmk-v1-069", "category": "option_field_plugin", "context_hash": "d04fb30b4f799dddc0c4da645e3cc7d0711dca1b0b2c7618a18454581e51ef29", "msgctxt": "doc/texinfo/fields.texi|Top|paragraph|InField#5", "msgid": "Input field tag@*\nType: integer@*\nDefault value: @code{1}", "msgid_sha256": "ea10b7ca6442b116c11cfa18288ea936b4bf188a537180958ab23e0ece99e88d", "node": "Top", "protected_hash": "69cfdbb7ee7c9e9ea7b5d598b71e01f30eb3c788ea7923da46ebdecb7f43f346", "protected_values": ["@*", "@*", "@code{1}"], "reference_translation": "输入字段标签@*\n类型：整数@*\n默认值：@code{1}", "reference_translation_status": "accepted", "role": "paragraph", "schema_version": 1, "selection_method": "sha256-stratified-v1", "selection_rank": "0487fae726d18cb738a33986fb989c2657821dee2d9ceaa9ade2b74669da7ac7", "semantic_key": "InField#5", "source_file": "doc/texinfo/fields.texi", "source_hash": "b68e49d6ed86d18a832bfff2b3e9ec819a17c88a215e4ef6a78e2314301d9dcc", "structure_path": "doc/texinfo/fields.texi::Top", "subcategory": "fields", "unit_id": "52158ff3ea8b37fd8511e04fc7c5a09532af805649d8d2d95170545d8688f75c"}
{"benchmark_id": "bmk-v1-070", "category": "option_field_plugin", "context_hash": "29885b93c98dec69daec7ce8c8bc83d3f74ea51e5424bc093b13ef5242321d5b", "msgctxt": "doc/texinfo/fields.texi|Top|paragraph|Sampling#2", "msgid": "Linear (i.e. per dimension) number of sampling points to discretize each curve and surface@*\nType: integer@*\nDefault value: @code{20}", "msgid_sha256": "33fad0d34a39789c7dec0baf3559f066546f1a3f8fb595ed8134eecc58b394ec", "node": "Top", "protected_hash": "3c11ead60ed5cf11c67f5542202dae4ba681b89bba8f330f376147d0d2e13f3c", "protected_values": ["@*", "@*", "@code{20}"], "reference_translation": "用于在每个维度上离散每条曲线和曲面的采样点数@*\n类型：整数@*\n默认值：@code{20}", "reference_translation_status": "accepted", "role": "paragraph", "schema_version": 1, "selection_method": "sha256-stratified-v1", "selection_rank": "055edac4400d28a830a9de56ef3e7f9279fb5cf4c3097d18c5e76f9aa3742dae", "semantic_key": "Sampling#2", "source_file": "doc/texinfo/fields.texi", "source_hash": "35e132075461fdbdb4d96d81125236b9e0388dd9156a3643357ac226ca7f7a35", "structure_path": "doc/texinfo/fields.texi::Top", "subcategory": "fields", "unit_id": "ba94c6fe8eb09c21f613932d3ff9663f71449447894ae1979835afb8a976401d"}
{"benchmark_id": "bmk-v1-071", "category": "option_field_plugin", "context_hash": "1c38ae38ec3ff6419ef6c4ea7c2ecaa2f02a72927f1bc50d7632f94834bf9437", "msgctxt": "doc/texinfo/fields.texi|Top|paragraph|Delta#2", "msgid": "Finite difference step@*\nType: float@*\nDefault value: @code{0.0003464101615137755}", "msgid_sha256": "6f8a19faa9af60651e99633e4523f377fccf6e46d9699fb2c60c5476d18f240d", "node": "Top", "protected_hash": "aa6437b389195f6ae4e28f4ac6ae7132565ab7622b76f8ff62ec1806791a6b47", "protected_values": ["@*", "@*", "@code{0.0003464101615137755}"], "reference_translation": "有限差分步长@*\n类型：浮点数@*\n默认值：@code{0.0003464101615137755}", "reference_translation_status": "accepted", "role": "paragraph", "schema_version": 1, "selection_method": "sha256-stratified-v1", "selection_rank": "068f252642b72cfa7d4766b89a9e52e6ac454fe716230dadab3c5bde77844531", "semantic_key": "Delta#2", "source_file": "doc/texinfo/fields.texi", "source_hash": "f54ab61569a310635bf3bffd69621ae10cbefbb9bb4ab8d782c4eea061f5e960", "structure_path": "doc/texinfo/fields.texi::Top", "subcategory": "fields", "unit_id": "bd5e1f3eb0cad072024085e4a56c52bd86256dae112f21e85e24833defc26250"}
{"benchmark_id": "bmk-v1-072", "category": "option_field_plugin", "context_hash": "850b309f6927fdb497ebeb1a849b3e8a37d0e5519395e852c0422ac99d4488ba", "msgctxt": "doc/texinfo/fields.texi|Top|paragraph|InField#10", "msgid": "Tag of the field computing the input value, usually a distance@*\nType: integer@*\nDefault value: @code{0}", "msgid_sha256": "1f01efdfd3f83fb1ea4af0ecb249f120b485eb2ca1cbc2854eaf0b0663a0597b", "node": "Top", "protected_hash": "b1e414fa25bf37369cf71373d04726dc72e52e8b40bcd7e649d013f54aca18ee", "protected_values": ["@*", "@*", "@code{0}"], "reference_translation": "用于计算输入值的字段标签，通常是距离场@*\n类型：整数@*\n默认值：@code{0}", "reference_translation_status": "accepted", "role": "paragraph", "schema_version": 1, "selection_method": "sha256-stratified-v1", "selection_rank": "076d8e580579282abc7fbe3a462dcc566d3c4596bf565968d4935abe58c2a0f7", "semantic_key": "InField#10", "source_file": "doc/texinfo/fields.texi", "source_hash": "cdc0492985c583f44f44471ebef259d005e0cc54d033b5e3e04d71479ada4d44", "structure_path": "doc/texinfo/fields.texi::Top", "subcategory": "fields", "unit_id": "dcf0ce27a038e89482f6562608f379c62916fcbaeaa0e760562e57218d0f8c99"}
{"benchmark_id": "bmk-v1-073", "category": "option_field_plugin", "context_hash": "99330256f701c4d904b0732e931faeed9fdbbe8b05eff1ca61bbf1ac8b10c7e3", "msgctxt": "doc/texinfo/fields.texi|Top|paragraph|hMin", "msgid": "Minimum size@*\nType: float@*\nDefault value: @code{-1}", "msgid_sha256": "9456a686d1c070716e515fddb764f3adda0fe75aca40e11c740e861fc81dc8c1", "node": "Top", "protected_hash": "95e31b37fd03ad28acac1cfcb14f6962a5dffa9230369ec27d127bfa22d7c14e", "protected_values": ["@*", "@*", "@code{-1}"], "reference_translation": "最小尺寸@*\n类型：浮点数@*\n默认值：@code{-1}", "reference_translation_status": "accepted", "role": "paragraph", "schema_version": 1, "selection_method": "sha256-stratified-v1", "selection_rank": "0a1209380bf7dea1f622c966add6ba82ef176dfc74cbfdead6385220bac25b68", "semantic_key": "hMin", "source_file": "doc/texinfo/fields.texi", "source_hash": "fc6af4a8ea7333a38a5b5455fb12eb80a47d36d8218080dedece420fe397cba8", "structure_path": "doc/texinfo/fields.texi::Top", "subcategory": "fields", "unit_id": "7ee512746e62665684c4ed8c552965c8555cbbbde4d760d4a7dfa2e354c84d94"}
{"benchmark_id": "bmk-v1-074", "category": "option_field_plugin", "context_hash": "759cdd68f025e2fe27d992ab6585bdd953fdc31c428595a42b2edf951e5ddebd", "msgctxt": "doc/texinfo/plugins.texi|Top|paragraph|Plugin(HarmonicToTime)", "msgid": "Plugin(HarmonicToTime) takes the values in the time steps `RealPart' and `ImaginaryPart' of the view `View', and creates a new view containing@*\n@*\n`View'[`RealPart'] * cos(p) +- `View'[`ImaginaryPart'] * sin(p)@*\nwith@*\n p = 2*Pi*k/`NumSteps', k = 0, ..., `NumSteps'-1@*\nand 'NumSteps' the total number of time steps@*\nover 'NumPeriods' periods at frequency 'Frequency' [Hz].@*\nThe '+' sign is used if `TimeSign'>0, the '-' sign otherwise.@*\n@*\nIf `View' < 0, the plugin is run on the current view.@*\n@*\nPlugin(HarmonicToTime) creates one new list-based view.\nNumeric options:", "msgid_sha256": "3ddbe3ec6a4ca70f32f04957d04c876eaf3cfe719b1819291f77607f0f9c544d", "node": "Top", "protected_hash": "b9392633d81da0379e4f09055f86e57052b058bf4f4e0151591a669f904a8df3", "protected_values": ["@*", "@*", "@*", "@*", "2", "0", "1", "@*", "@*", "@*", "0", "@*", "@*", "0", "@*", "@*"], "reference_translation": "Plugin(HarmonicToTime) 获取视图 `View' 在时间步 `RealPart' 和 `ImaginaryPart' 处的值，并创建一个包含以下结果的新视图：@*\n@*\n`View'[`RealPart'] * cos(p) +- `View'[`ImaginaryPart'] * sin(p)@*\n其中@*\n p = 2*Pi*k/`NumSteps', k = 0, ..., `NumSteps'-1@*\n且 'NumSteps' 是总时间步数，@*\n即在频率为 'Frequency' [Hz] 下跨越 'NumPeriods' 个周期。@*\n当 `TimeSign'>0 时使用 '+' 号，否则使用 '-' 号。@*\n@*\n如果 `View' < 0，则插件在当前视图上运行。@*\n@*\nPlugin(HarmonicToTime) 创建一个新的基于列表的视图。\n数值选项：", "reference_translation_status": "accepted", "role": "paragraph", "schema_version": 1, "selection_method": "sha256-stratified-v1", "selection_rank": "07edd00f02f09bf514a539730c60e33fb29d2200afac9d866facb36cecbff999", "semantic_key": "Plugin(HarmonicToTime)", "source_file": "doc/texinfo/plugins.texi", "source_hash": "a1402ccf0b2f1452bb7dce56fee456b8bbffd010b57f63e967e0a11b3ade8d8d", "structure_path": "doc/texinfo/plugins.texi::Top", "subcategory": "plugins", "unit_id": "384d45a95249ba155632d96332ce3e5cbd797df74829cd591278c96ee76cebca"}
{"benchmark_id": "bmk-v1-075", "category": "option_field_plugin", "context_hash": "1c0bfd87ae65bae1cef7c085d839cd88b18a59bb5d6c959227a65f82323d1d11", "msgctxt": "doc/texinfo/plugins.texi|Top|paragraph|Plugin(Smooth)", "msgid": "Plugin(Smooth) averages the values at the nodes of the view `View'.@*\n@*\nIf `View' < 0, the plugin is run on the current view.@*\n@*\nPlugin(Smooth) is executed in-place.\nNumeric options:", "msgid_sha256": "36643d75e107cd9110276978c34be740b1b07e05210fb920087ddbf70068bf07", "node": "Top", "protected_hash": "e30efafa06fd1fa3e6261f7501a4cd9669e95c2cd79016d2cb57a31fc24c8f72", "protected_values": ["@*", "@*", "0", "@*", "@*"], "reference_translation": "Plugin(Smooth) 对视图 `View' 各节点处的值求平均。@*\n@*\n如果 `View' < 0，则插件在当前视图上运行。@*\n@*\nPlugin(Smooth) 就地执行。\n数值选项：", "reference_translation_status": "accepted", "role": "paragraph", "schema_version": 1, "selection_method": "sha256-stratified-v1", "selection_rank": "08e7c2d7ba827c0f936907d189a543fbab6fadddaf1a334b439256144055b28e", "semantic_key": "Plugin(Smooth)", "source_file": "doc/texinfo/plugins.texi", "source_hash": "9a8c16f0961117e4e53e644a3cf1b35b45a8f24eb36895345dab142b8a29a066", "structure_path": "doc/texinfo/plugins.texi::Top", "subcategory": "plugins", "unit_id": "06024c8054215f22b610066481761a4b319533776b334e59760e1d6d15174633"}
{"benchmark_id": "bmk-v1-076", "category": "option_field_plugin", "context_hash": "97eab9553591adce637cf8fc143b2ad7b22b3a533c38693fbae59a57a61e1ed8", "msgctxt": "doc/texinfo/plugins.texi|Top|paragraph|Plugin(MinMax)", "msgid": "Plugin(MinMax) computes the min/max of a view.@*\n@*\nIf `View' < 0, the plugin is run on the current view. If `OverTime' = 1, the plugin calculates the min/max over space and time. If `Argument' = 1, the plugin calculates the min/max and the argmin/argmax. If `Visible' = 1, the plugin is only applied to visible entities.@*\n@*\nPlugin(MinMax) creates two new list-based views.\nNumeric options:", "msgid_sha256": "23bf64343599adac02d12019330e3eca0419272f7355478989409155a4bf27fc", "node": "Top", "protected_hash": "7477a409589488eb355c6bf0cd372438d9d1016dc1b41280df31b5f1b79a4de6", "protected_values": ["@*", "@*", "0", "1", "1", "1", "@*", "@*"], "reference_translation": "Plugin(MinMax) 计算某个视图的 min/max。@*\n@*\n如果 `View' < 0，则插件在当前视图上运行。如果 `OverTime' = 1，则插件计算空间和时间上的 min/max。如果 `Argument' = 1，则插件计算 min/max 以及 argmin/argmax。如果 `Visible' = 1，则插件仅应用于可见实体。@*\n@*\nPlugin(MinMax) 创建两个新的基于列表的视图。\n数值选项：", "reference_translation_status": "accepted", "role": "paragraph", "schema_version": 1, "selection_method": "sha256-stratified-v1", "selection_rank": "105a4f12b97bfb596b040d27de34396a5171319d5675c49d684efe72f4f194fc", "semantic_key": "Plugin(MinMax)", "source_file": "doc/texinfo/plugins.texi", "source_hash": "990af006e0c89eb23b711d14e5a4294bdd3fa442bc44900dc7be131896b84896", "structure_path": "doc/texinfo/plugins.texi::Top", "subcategory": "plugins", "unit_id": "46b7091981579d302664c4dd684c92deeae10d7ce8ee339159243c5eed53a7cf"}
{"benchmark_id": "bmk-v1-077", "category": "option_field_plugin", "context_hash": "83dace8c462454f3a83b10c962385d51f0a5105ef06c394ea1d0a56d04f1d183", "msgctxt": "doc/texinfo/plugins.texi|Top|paragraph|Plugin(SpanningTree)", "msgid": "Plugin(SpanningTree) builds a tree spanning every vertex of a mesh and stores it directly in the model.@*\nThe tree is constructed by starting first on the curves, then on the surfaces and finally on the volumes.@*\n@*\nParameters@*\n- PhysicalVolumes: list of the physical volumes upon which the tree must be built.@*\n- PhysicalSurfaces: list of the physical surfaces upon which the tree must be built.@*\n- PhysicalCurves: list of the physical curves upon which the tree must be built.@*\n- OutputPhysical: physical tag of the generated tree (-1 will select a new tag automatically).@*\n@*\nNote - Lists must be comma separated integers and spaces are ignored.@*\nRemark - This plugin does not overwrite a physical group.Therefore, if an existing physical tag is used in OutputPhysical, the edges of the tree will be /added/ to the specified group.\nString options:", "msgid_sha256": "10614b56318497a5ed5dd6d6421b19a229f67d69c0f01ab30a10d12767178278", "node": "Top", "protected_hash": "c510795cb176ba3e12ecf3e6765af2c3f4a955708e55dd59645964be3cbc156b", "protected_values": ["@*", "@*", "@*", "@*", "@*", "@*", "@*", "1", "@*", "@*", "@*"], "reference_translation": "Plugin(SpanningTree) 构建一棵覆盖网格每个顶点的树，并将其直接存储在模型中。@*\n该树构建时先处理曲线，再处理曲面，最后处理体。@*\n@*\n参数@*\n- PhysicalVolumes：必须在其上构建该树的物理体列表。@*\n- PhysicalSurfaces：必须在其上构建该树的物理曲面列表。@*\n- PhysicalCurves：必须在其上构建该树的物理曲线列表。@*\n- OutputPhysical：生成树的物理标签（-1 将自动选择新标签）。@*\n@*\n注意：列表必须由逗号分隔的整数组成，空格将被忽略。@*\n备注：此插件不会覆盖物理组。因此，如果 OutputPhysical 中使用了现有物理标签，树的边将被添加到指定组中。\n字符串选项：", "reference_translation_status": "accepted", "role": "paragraph", "schema_version": 1, "selection_method": "sha256-stratified-v1", "selection_rank": "113bb9c7649696b75940d402b90fd6ddc1c7cf4901d9b7dfadfd3f44bdbe37b5", "semantic_key": "Plugin(SpanningTree)", "source_file": "doc/texinfo/plugins.texi", "source_hash": "8a0a598ad233eb53e8d1baba872caa1a65f5d53fe5d0cbbda31cf68b18fd20c3", "structure_path": "doc/texinfo/plugins.texi::Top", "subcategory": "plugins", "unit_id": "5ba434d48b55855307c213edd60ad4e16edddb07598a22f24eb1721e29cf4c2c"}
{"benchmark_id": "bmk-v1-078", "category": "option_field_plugin", "context_hash": "5539e00337847dc834ba3874149264c349e8aaf8b93c21ab713ae38f3df97be2", "msgctxt": "doc/texinfo/plugins.texi|Top|paragraph|Plugin(SphericalRaise)", "msgid": "Plugin(SphericalRaise) transforms the coordinates of the elements in the view `View' using the values associated with the `TimeStep'-th time step.@*\n@*\nInstead of elevating the nodes along the X, Y and Z axes as with the View[`View'].RaiseX, View[`View'].RaiseY and View[`View'].RaiseZ options, the raise is applied along the radius of a sphere centered at (`Xc', `Yc', `Zc').@*\n@*\nTo produce a standard radiation pattern, set `Offset' to minus the radius of the sphere the original data lives on.@*\n@*\nIf `View' < 0, the plugin is run on the current view.@*\n@*\nPlugin(SphericalRaise) is executed in-place.\nNumeric options:", "msgid_sha256": "3af21ed2737a596f550752c823557335536caf003fbab3312d5d467b193e68b8", "node": "Top", "protected_hash": "1e44507596d2f4731e63c6d6e858ad2dafba829e8b9afc3b851e34154655905e", "protected_values": ["@*", "@*", "@*", "@*", "@*", "@*", "0", "@*", "@*"], "reference_translation": "Plugin(SphericalRaise) 使用与第 `TimeStep' 个时间步相关联的值变换视图 `View' 中网格单元的坐标。@*\n@*\n不同于使用 View[`View'].RaiseX、View[`View'].RaiseY 和 View[`View'].RaiseZ 选项沿 X、Y 和 Z 轴抬升节点，这里的抬升沿以 (`Xc', `Yc', `Zc') 为中心的球体半径方向进行。@*\n@*\n要生成标准辐射图样，请将 `Offset' 设置为原始数据所在球体半径的负值。@*\n@*\n如果 `View' < 0，则插件在当前视图上运行。@*\n@*\nPlugin(SphericalRaise) 就地执行。\n数值选项：", "reference_translation_status": "accepted", "role": "paragraph", "schema_version": 1, "selection_method": "sha256-stratified-v1", "selection_rank": "1896e848075f530da15474e2e758e44da9cb8fa26cb47955f587470d0facfe7b", "semantic_key": "Plugin(SphericalRaise)", "source_file": "doc/texinfo/plugins.texi", "source_hash": "22b213abc2aa0bfc8a57caae957116915a5eb33186803fe0557acde5045b1b08", "structure_path": "doc/texinfo/plugins.texi::Top", "subcategory": "plugins", "unit_id": "aac04370404a762b1b0d0fbfa78c5c2cb43957bd2e980c184857127e8463371a"}
{"benchmark_id": "bmk-v1-079", "category": "option_field_plugin", "context_hash": "5c49e22a6d92ae1dd5078802253083350366a5e6f6dd4f28d57025a6b3510238", "msgctxt": "doc/texinfo/plugins.texi|Top|paragraph|Plugin(VoroMetal)", "msgid": "Plugin(VoroMetal) creates microstructures using Voronoi diagrams.@*\n@*", "msgid_sha256": "58ccdb46e178d9614f50f2de0491b482063f0ee4be28d4aa6f8c0eee24c10d50", "node": "Top", "protected_hash": "c03d2e617beb8dfdec674df55fb90f8279539d414bb07025bddcb0a7be505d91", "protected_values": ["@*", "@*"], "reference_translation": "Plugin(VoroMetal) 使用 Voronoi 图创建微观结构。@*\n@*", "reference_translation_status": "accepted", "role": "paragraph", "schema_version": 1, "selection_method": "sha256-stratified-v1", "selection_rank": "1c1b63ae7098f89f0e12f3fdfe5ef1820ee93d2ecf378f62d453846d42209546", "semantic_key": "Plugin(VoroMetal)", "source_file": "doc/texinfo/plugins.texi", "source_hash": "d2d332d15fed984d22cbfcfe43fc552b4ae3cd875e368ce0f1a08d2d5baf2853", "structure_path": "doc/texinfo/plugins.texi::Top", "subcategory": "plugins", "unit_id": "d90ef5d742f3bb9b76bd81c33dfbbe4067bdea722fd15e125f83f5d082b82d6b"}
{"benchmark_id": "bmk-v1-080", "category": "option_field_plugin", "context_hash": "f23b279bf8cbe7ead867f529080e876aa1e52df53f1534866ea24de5dffa93f7", "msgctxt": "doc/texinfo/plugins.texi|Top|paragraph|Plugin(Summation)", "msgid": "Plugin(Summation) sums every time steps of 'Reference View' and (every) 'Other View X'and store the result in a new view.@*\nIf 'View 0' < 0 then the current view is selected.@*\nIf 'View 1...8' < 0 then this view is skipped.@*\nViews can have different number of time steps@*\nWarning: the Plugin assume that every views sharethe same mesh and that meshes do not move between time steps!\nString options:", "msgid_sha256": "96ef56a4b954a93b876fb2e92e262da1cacf8306367cb81a14d45a88bc0eebe7", "node": "Top", "protected_hash": "9da29d395881c58fa568a0faebcf0b1fcf22993ed1fd3efff0aab08c60a336c7", "protected_values": ["@*", "0", "0", "@*", "1", "8", "0", "@*", "@*"], "reference_translation": "Plugin(Summation) 将 'Reference View' 和（每个）'Other View X' 的所有时间步相加，并将结果存储在新视图中。@*\n如果 'View 0' < 0，则选择当前视图。@*\n如果 'View 1...8' < 0，则跳过此视图。@*\n视图可以有不同数量的时间步。@*\n警告：该插件假定所有视图共享同一网格，并且网格在时间步之间不会移动！\n字符串选项：", "reference_translation_status": "accepted", "role": "paragraph", "schema_version": 1, "selection_method": "sha256-stratified-v1", "selection_rank": "2308577c4508c4e173ec44bdac35eb1e1b773324d7b42287f04a0becf32a55fc", "semantic_key": "Plugin(Summation)", "source_file": "doc/texinfo/plugins.texi", "source_hash": "6b592292b114fefd211c51e080e0a2647ce0f1fb700f61ef2209ce71ec1ec970", "structure_path": "doc/texinfo/plugins.texi::Top", "subcategory": "plugins", "unit_id": "a0fbc802cadbabc2af1ffafb3c02479d25ffe97d81252233fa42d633146da024"}
